      ],
      "source": "https://appalachianhistorian.org/coldiron-harlan-county-family-name-river-road-and-the-making-of-a-small-mountain-community/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Despite remaining a very small settlement, Coldiron’s simple persistence has made it a notable part of Harlan County’s history.",
